        {
         "id": "caption-1484",
         "type": "text",
         "name": "Caption",
         "content": "Section reveals, hover and focus transitions and the header swap are native CSS. GSAP is justified only for the events row's eased scroll-to and the staggered mission-cell reveal. Lottie is justified only for the hero mark's one-time load-in, shipped as .lottie. Every one has a prefers-reduced-motion equivalent: reveals become instant, the mark becomes its finished static frame, hover keeps colour and shadow and drops movement.",
         "fontFamily": "$fontBody",
         "fontSize": 12,
         "fontWeight": "500",
         "lineHeight": 1.55,
         "letterSpacing": 0,
         "fill": "$inkMeta",
         "width": 1010,
         "textGrowth": "fixed-width"
        },
