  {
   "id": "read-me-1489",
   "type": "note",
   "name": "READ ME",
   "content": "LOGICA landing page mockup. Frames: 00 cover and tokens, 01 desktop 1440, 02 mobile 390, 03 interaction states. Section order follows CONTENT.md s1 exactly: Introduction, Mission, Upcoming Events, Featured Content, Call to Action, inside a persistent header and footer. Nothing here is production copy or a production asset. Event entries are plausible placeholder scheduling. Featured Content is a labelled placeholder because that slot only ever carries a real, named LOGICA member. The hero object is vector staging for a pre-rendered asset, not the shipping asset.",
   "x": 0,
   "y": -150,
   "width": 900,
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": "$fontBody"
  }
 ]
}